[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 13680.71, "timestamp": "03:48:00", "text": "以及其他事情。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13684.469, "timestamp": "03:48:04", "text": "我以前也这样做过，我以前……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13687.429, "timestamp": "03:48:07", "text": "比如，做一个总结性的总结，就像……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13690.389, "timestamp": "03:48:10", "text": "我们今天做的事情就像第一天一样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13692.309, "timestamp": "03:48:12", "text": "音乐制作学习第二天"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13694.87, "timestamp": "03:48:14", "text": "如何才能拍出那样的作品。我过去常常放"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13698.349, "timestamp": "03:48:18", "text": "在推特之类的平台上都有。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13702.55, "timestamp": "03:48:22", "text": "嗯，所以我知道我可以采用什么格式。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13705.95, "timestamp": "03:48:25", "text": "以及所有的一切。我运用我的运动健将技巧"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13709.269, "timestamp": "03:48:29", "text": "呃，比如我作为运动员学到的东西。我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13711.75, "timestamp": "03:48:31", "text": "摆放得恰到好处。但是，我再次强调。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13713.75, "timestamp": "03:48:33", "text": "我已经暂时不用那个化名了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13716.55, "timestamp": "03:48:36", "text": "待一晚，待一会儿。从此"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13726.15, "timestamp": "03:48:46", "text": "虽然我知道我能做到。我知道我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13728.67, "timestamp": "03:48:48", "text": "可以做到。我必须这么做。但"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13730.91, "timestamp": "03:48:50", "text": "为什么"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13733.429, "timestamp": "03:48:53", "text": "直播了这么久，累死了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13734.91, "timestamp": "03:48:54", "text": "24"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13737.91, "timestamp": "03:48:57", "text": "小时。但这并非借口。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13739.71, "timestamp": "03:48:59", "text": "我必须这样做"}]